                    R = list(range(a+1, a+r+1))
                    cur_sumR = sum(R)
                    deficit = s - cur_sumR  # need to increase sum by deficit
                    # We can increase numbers arbitrarily while keeping distinctness.
                    # So feasible as long as deficit >=0, which we ensured s >= min_right.
                    # So both sides feasible.
